From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:12:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] Add ALL pseudo-team with cross-team channel list

A tile in the team sidebar switches the channel sidebar to one list of
channels from every team plus DMs and GMs, with a mini team icon on each
channel. Categories, sorting and drag-and-drop order are kept in
localStorage and synced to /__all_teams_layout when a local server offers it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
